      "text": "958. 80\n1, 291. 80 1, 291. 80\n0 - 2  2................................. 958. 80 958. 80\nO -l 2 ................................. 756. 60 756. 60 756. 60\n1  While serving as Chairman of the Joint Chiefs of Staff, Chief of Staff  \nof the Army, Chief of Naval Operations, Chief of Staff of the Air Force,  \nor Commandant of the Marine Corps, basic pay for this grade is $3,976.20*  \nregardless of cumulative years of service computed under section 205 of  \nthis title.\n2  Does not apply to commissioned officers who have been credited with \nover 4 years’ active service as enlisted members.\n*The rate of basic pay for military personnel at these rates is limited by  \nsectipn 5308 of title 5, United States Code, as added by the Federal Pay  \nComparability Act of 1970, to the rate for level V  of the Executive Schedule \n($36,000 per annum, or $3,000 per month as of the effective date of this  \nadjustment)."
    },
